% PostScript Data Processing Utility - Transformer Module
% Handles data transformation.

/transformer {
  % Placeholder for transformation logic
  % Expects transformed data to be on the stack
  current_data dup 
  0 get 
  length 
  2 mod 0 eq { 
    % Example: Filter even length strings
    dup 
  } { 
    pop 
    current_data get 
  } ifelse
} def
